hed to any<br /> human or raven \u2014 Kin or no \u2014 to create a new Tengu. It<br /> is somewhat inauspicious to select non-Kinfolk for such an<br /> honor, but one does occasionally hear stories of Tengu who<br /> so desire a particular child that they kidnap the objects of<br /> their paternal affection.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-29T03:13:43-08:00","id":1283476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1273072-fera-breeding-ratios?p=1282532#post1282532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was mistaken I thought it was in heng but the line is the other way around<br /> <br /> &quot;Nonetheless, the spirit egg can be attached to any<br /> human or raven \u2014 Kin or no \u2014 to create a new Tengu. It<br /> is somewhat inauspicious to select non-Kinfolk for such an<br /> honor, but one does occasionally hear stories of Tengu who<br /> so desire a particular child that they kidnap the objects of<br /> their paternal affection.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is lifted from where ?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1